    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "A focused dungeon-running romp through the land of Relaryia! The land is sliding into chaos, and Avatars have emerged from the elemental planes to restore balance to the land by rooting out the sources of corruption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a variety of dungeons and places including crypts, ruined castles, deep forests, with more dungeons being added over time!</strong></li></ul><strong>Turn based battles with unique strategies that build on:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Character skills and synergies - most skills have multiple functions<br></li><li>    Weapon and Elemental damage types / Enemy Weaknesses and resistances<br></li><li>    Statuses that can be used in combination with some abilities</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble your team of Elemental Avatars!</strong></h2><strong>Gren - Avatar of Flame</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A strong melee fighter that wields a greatsword and elemental fire to scorch his enemies!</li></ul><strong>Tiefe - Avatar of Water</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mystical warrior with a scythe along with water and ice spells to damage and impede enemies!</li></ul><strong>Holtz - Avatar of Earth</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A naturalist who employs a staff along with earthen magic to heal allies and crush foes!</li></ul><strong>Aike - Avatar of Storm</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A wild dual-axe swinging barbarian harnessing the storm to deliver thunderous, rapid pain to her adversaries!</li></ul><strong>Ratha - Avatar of Light</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A stalwart healer and caster with a hammer that heals her friends and judges enemies with the power of light!</li></ul><strong>Sareth - Avatar of Darkness</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A crafty whip wielder that shifts with the shadows, shaping the darkness to her will to break her enemies down!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A focused dungeon-running romp through the land of Relaryia! The land is sliding into chaos, and Avatars have emerged from the elemental planes to restore balance to the land by rooting out the sources of corruption.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a variety of dungeons and places including crypts, ruined castles, deep forests, with more dungeons being added over time!</strong></li></ul><strong>Turn based battles with unique strategies that build on:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Character skills and synergies - most skills have multiple functions<br></li><li>    Weapon and Elemental damage types / Enemy Weaknesses and resistances<br></li><li>    Statuses that can be used in combination with some abilities</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble your team of Elemental Avatars!</strong></h2><strong>Gren - Avatar of Flame</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A strong melee fighter that wields a greatsword and elemental fire to scorch his enemies!</li></ul><strong>Tiefe - Avatar of Water</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A mystical warrior with a scythe along with water and ice spells to damage and impede enemies!</li></ul><strong>Holtz - Avatar of Earth</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A naturalist who employs a staff along with earthen magic to heal allies and crush foes!</li></ul><strong>Aike - Avatar of Storm</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A wild dual-axe swinging barbarian harnessing the storm to deliver thunderous, rapid pain to her adversaries!</li></ul><strong>Ratha - Avatar of Light</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A stalwart healer and caster with a hammer that heals her friends and judges enemies with the power of light!</li></ul><strong>Sareth - Avatar of Darkness</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A crafty whip wielder that shifts with the shadows, shaping the darkness to her will to break her enemies down!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A focused dungeon running romp through the fantasy world of Relaryia! The land is sliding into chaos, and it's up to you with the help of a party of 4 elemental avatars to bring balance back to the world. Pick your favorites from Fire, Water, Storm, Earth, Light, and Darkness and cleanse the world!",
